WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.250
What happens when 800 of the world’s most elite footballers

00:00:03.250 --> 00:00:05.666
and their managers live together under one roof?

00:00:05.666 --> 00:00:05.750
Players stop being polite

00:00:05.750 --> 00:00:07.458
Players stop being polite

00:00:07.458 --> 00:00:09.583
and start getting Real.

00:00:09.583 --> 00:00:10.208
This is

00:00:10.208 --> 00:00:11.625
The Champions

00:00:11.625 --> 00:00:14.333
If you need a cross into the box,

00:00:14.333 --> 00:00:16.750
pray you have an Angel on your wing.

00:00:16.750 --> 00:00:18.875
Money can't buy you silverware...

00:00:18.875 --> 00:00:21.000
is what the chairman keeps telling me. 

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:23.250
Don't hate me because I'm beautiful. 

00:00:23.250 --> 00:00:25.500
Hate me because I had a great World Cup

00:00:25.500 --> 00:00:26.416
five years ago

00:00:26.416 --> 00:00:27.958
and not much else. 

00:00:27.958 --> 00:00:29.375
I'm not the new Ronaldo. 

00:00:29.375 --> 00:00:31.458
I'm the first Vinicius. 

00:00:31.458 --> 00:00:33.750
Oh, except for Vinicius Sr. 

00:00:38.416 --> 00:00:42.083
OLE, OLE, OLE, OLE, OLE

00:00:42.083 --> 00:00:47.708
OLE, OLE, OLE, OLE, OLE, OLE

00:00:47.708 --> 00:00:49.500
Hey you guys, sorry Gareth bailed

00:00:49.500 --> 00:00:51.291
but thanks for taking the rest of us out!

00:00:51.291 --> 00:00:53.250
Now you are just like your season...

00:00:53.250 --> 00:00:54.541
totally wasted!

00:00:57.250 --> 00:00:58.333
Per La Liga tradition, 

00:00:58.333 --> 00:01:00.958
every night we all get dinner at 11 p.m. 

00:01:00.958 --> 00:01:02.041
and go to the club

00:01:02.041 --> 00:01:03.208
till about 3 a.m., 

00:01:03.208 --> 00:01:04.666
which makes us perfectly ready

00:01:04.666 --> 00:01:05.666
for breakfast at noon

00:01:05.666 --> 00:01:06.875
and a match at 1. 

00:01:07.500 --> 00:01:09.125
Antoine, do you want red or white? 

00:01:09.125 --> 00:01:11.916
Hmmmm. That is a tough choice.

00:01:18.708 --> 00:01:21.458
I used to wear the 10 shirt too, you know. 

00:01:21.458 --> 00:01:22.416
Let the Little Magician

00:01:22.416 --> 00:01:23.666
show you how it's done. 

00:01:25.625 --> 00:01:27.875
Ta-da. I make it disappear! See?!

00:01:27.875 --> 00:01:28.708
Uh, guys...

00:01:28.708 --> 00:01:30.958
excuse me, um, could you-

00:01:32.416 --> 00:01:35.541
Uh, yeah, would you mind keeping it down please? 

00:01:35.541 --> 00:01:37.666
I mean, who sleeps that much?

00:01:37.666 --> 00:01:39.458
What planet is he from? 

00:01:39.458 --> 00:01:40.875
Come on, Gareth, 

00:01:40.875 --> 00:01:42.916
For once, have fun with us. 

00:01:42.916 --> 00:01:44.291
Slow down. 

00:01:44.291 --> 00:01:45.875
You know I have a problem

00:01:45.875 --> 00:01:47.791
with conversational Spanish!

00:01:47.791 --> 00:01:50.458
We are speaking English to you. 

00:01:50.458 --> 00:01:52.708
We just have accents. 

00:01:52.708 --> 00:01:53.458
I don't know why 

00:01:53.458 --> 00:01:54.708
I haven't been able to fit in...

00:01:54.708 --> 00:01:56.500
I've even learned all the Spanish I need. 

00:01:56.500 --> 00:01:57.916
I mean, go ahead. Test me. 

00:01:57.916 --> 00:01:59.791
Okay, como estas? 

00:01:59.791 --> 00:02:01.583
Estoy herido. 

00:02:01.583 --> 00:02:02.583
Que paso? 

00:02:02.583 --> 00:02:05.958
...Estoy herido. 

00:02:05.958 --> 00:02:08.000
Okay. Uh, you need a scrunchie? 

00:02:08.000 --> 00:02:09.083
Two words. 

00:02:09.083 --> 00:02:10.000
Do you want us to be louder? 

00:02:10.000 --> 00:02:10.708
Sounds like...

00:02:10.708 --> 00:02:11.166
You want a transfer?

00:02:12.208 --> 00:02:13.791
Whoa! 

00:02:13.791 --> 00:02:15.333
Not cool, man. 

00:02:15.333 --> 00:02:16.375
Oh, oh no.

00:02:16.375 --> 00:02:17.166
I'm sorry.

00:02:17.166 --> 00:02:18.916
It's just I need to be at my best

00:02:18.916 --> 00:02:19.916
for tomorrow's big match. 

00:02:19.916 --> 00:02:20.833
Big match? 

00:02:20.833 --> 00:02:22.958
Uh, we are out of the Champions League

00:02:22.958 --> 00:02:24.000
and the Copa del Rey.

00:02:24.000 --> 00:02:26.250
And right now we only play La Liga matches

00:02:26.250 --> 00:02:28.125
to get out of the house once in a while. 

00:02:28.125 --> 00:02:28.666
Oh, no no no.

00:02:28.666 --> 00:02:30.000
My big golf match...

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:31.583
I'm trying to beat my personal best.

00:02:31.583 --> 00:02:33.958
Uh, unless you want to join...?

00:02:33.958 --> 00:02:36.500
Anyone? 

00:02:36.500 --> 00:02:39.416
Alright, well, see you later.

00:02:39.416 --> 00:02:40.041
What's his deal?! 

00:02:40.041 --> 00:02:40.791
Oh my God. 

00:02:40.791 --> 00:02:42.250
The man sucks.

00:02:42.250 --> 00:02:44.625
We have a lot of nicknames for Gareth, 

00:02:44.625 --> 00:02:47.041
like "the Martian" because we don't like him,

00:02:47.041 --> 00:02:49.541
"the Golfer" because we don't like him,

00:02:49.541 --> 00:02:53.625
or like "Less Good Ronaldo" because we don't like him. 

00:02:54.250 --> 00:02:55.000
I don't know. 

00:02:55.000 --> 00:02:56.041
Something's off with him, man. 

00:02:56.041 --> 00:02:58.833
Nobody in their right mind wouldn't want to hang out with us. 

00:02:58.833 --> 00:03:00.500
Maybe he wants a transfer? 

00:03:00.500 --> 00:03:01.416
Maybe he's faking an injury? 

00:03:01.416 --> 00:03:03.250
I know! Let's go through his stuff

00:03:03.250 --> 00:03:04.375
to find out what he's hiding. 

00:03:04.375 --> 00:03:05.875
We could maybe instead go to sleep

00:03:05.875 --> 00:03:08.291
and practice more so we stop losing...

00:03:13.166 --> 00:03:16.166
Guys, I found something. 

00:03:16.208 --> 00:03:18.500
Why is his pencil so small?

00:03:18.500 --> 00:03:20.250
I'm scared. 

00:03:23.041 --> 00:03:24.625
He really is a martian! 

00:03:24.625 --> 00:03:26.541
What's going on? Is it tee time already?!

00:03:26.541 --> 00:03:27.833
Get away from us, alien!

00:03:27.833 --> 00:03:30.041
You're different, and we hate you.

00:03:30.041 --> 00:03:31.750
But that's just my Welsh books,

00:03:31.750 --> 00:03:34.750
my golf pencils and my exfoliating mask.

00:03:34.750 --> 00:03:36.583
Please...por favor.

00:03:36.583 --> 00:03:38.833
Oh NOW you speak Spanish. 

00:03:38.833 --> 00:03:40.916
I tried to fit in.

00:03:40.916 --> 00:03:42.416
But after six years,

00:03:42.416 --> 00:03:45.375
it's clear I am the only true Galactico here.

00:03:45.375 --> 00:03:47.041
I don't belong at Real Madrid.

00:03:47.041 --> 00:03:48.958
It's time for me to go home.

00:04:30.125 --> 00:04:32.500
I will stick with the red. Thank you!

00:04:32.500 --> 00:04:34.208
Uh, guys?

